Package: ffsim
Type: Package
Title: Simulation Tools for the Flattened Franchise HDP Modification
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Siyi", "Chen", email = "siyi.chen@example.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A base-R reference implementation of the Flattened Franchise (FF),
    a sublinear occupancy transform applied at the Chinese Restaurant Table
    step of a hierarchical Dirichlet process sampler. The package provides the
    defining transform, a conditional weight-layer experiment that isolates the
    eta^(-1/2) inflation of the minority-weight posterior standard deviation,
    and a full finite weak-limit HDP Gibbs sampler for clustering, together
    with table and figure output. The numbers are produced by the code; the
    package does not reproduce any specific published table.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    utils
URL: https://github.com/siyichen/ffsim
BugReports: https://github.com/siyichen/ffsim/issues
